                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <www:question xml:lang="en">The examiner names three unrelated objects clearly and slowly, then
asks the patient to name all three of them. The patient’s response is
used for scoring. The examiner repeats them until patient learns all of
them, if possible. 

This item refers to the FIRST object (in ADNI: BALL).</www:question>
        <rdfs:label>MMSE_Registration_Item_1</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


