        <untitled-ontology-107:Definition>A villous structure of tangled masses of BLOOD VESSELS contained within the third, lateral, and fourth ventricles of the BRAIN. It regulates part of the production and composition of CEREBROSPINAL FLUID.</untitled-ontology-107:Definition>
