        <untitled-ontology-107:Definition>One of the convolutions on the medial surface of the CEREBRAL HEMISPHERES. It surrounds the rostral part of the brain and CORPUS CALLOSUM and forms part of the LIMBIC SYSTEM.</untitled-ontology-107:Definition>
