        <untitled-ontology-107:Definition>general or unspecified; prefer specific structures &amp; areas in the hypothalamus; HYPOTHALAMO-HYPOPHYSEAL SYSTEM is available for the hypothalamus-pituitary relationship</untitled-ontology-107:Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-107:MeSH_Unique_ID>D007031</untitled-ontology-107:MeSH_Unique_ID>
        <rdfs:label>Hypothalamus</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


