        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#Olfactory_pathway"/>
        <untitled-ontology-107:Definition>A convolution on the inferior surface of each cerebral hemisphere, lying between the hippocampal and collateral sulci.</untitled-ontology-107:Definition>
