        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#Cerebral_Cortex"/>
        <untitled-ontology-107:Definition>Upper central part of the cerebral hemisphere. It is located posterior to central sulcus, anterior to the OCCIPITAL LOBE, and superior to the TEMPORAL LOBES.</untitled-ontology-107:Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-107:MeSH_Unique_ID>D010296</untitled-ontology-107:MeSH_Unique_ID>
